# ==============================================================================
# JammuKhoj Environment Configuration & Optional API Keys
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: JammuKhoj is designed to be 100% functional with ZERO API keys!
# All map tiles, offline database, routing and safety directories run out-of-the-box.
#
# If you wish to connect external paid third-party cloud services in production,
# copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values below:

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google OAuth Client ID (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you want real production Google OAuth 2.0 instead of local browser simulation:
# Obtain from Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Map Provider Keys (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Currently using free, high-performance CartoDB Voyager and OSM tiles.
# If you want Mapbox vector styles:
# VITE_MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=pk.eyJ1Ijoi...
#
# If you want Google Maps JavaScript API SDK instead of MapLibre:
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Live Weather API Key (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Currently using verified regional weather feeds for Jammu Division.
# For live automated meteorological updates from OpenWeatherMap:
# VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweathermap_key

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Backend Cloud Database Sync (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Currently using local IndexedDB via Dexie with 100% offline persistence.
# For multi-device cloud synchronization via Supabase:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
